{"id":"n62508-1-8","stage":1,"title":"소파 · 沙发","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62508-1-8-1","ko":"소파가 참 커 보이네요.","zh":"这沙发看起来真大。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소파가","meaning":"沙发","explanation":"소파：沙发；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소파","audio":"/audio/d6dab8e7a021c768cde2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62508","senseId":"1","lemma":"소파","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소파가","audio":"/audio/6cc454486400b4654df3.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"커","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커","audio":"/audio/768798e62994baaa085d.mp3"}},{"text":"보이네요.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이네요","audio":"/audio/46898c8efbf3b62488a4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6dab8e7a021c768","term":"소파","zh":"沙发","audio":"/audio/d6dab8e7a021c768cde2.mp3","entryId":"62508","definition":"可以背靠着坐的又长又软的椅子。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/47aa30d5dc818c23e303.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62508-1-8-2","ko":"사 인용 소파하고 일인용 소파를 붙여 놓은 거예요.","zh":"这是把四人沙发和单人沙发拼在一起了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사","meaning":"四","explanation":"사：四。","readings":[{"term":"사","audio":"/audio/98ebd37ce3c1cd6abbe7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58114","senseId":"1","lemma":"사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사","audio":"/audio/98ebd37ce3c1cd6abbe7.mp3"}},{"text":"인용","meaning":"人用（사 인용：四人用）","explanation":"인：人（人数单位）；-용：供……使用。与前面的 사 合起来，사 인용 指供四人使用。","readings":[{"term":"인","audio":"/audio/4929f7cc03943d2c008e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24998","senseId":"2","lemma":"인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인용","audio":"/audio/4a02004ab78c6f5871be.mp3"}},{"text":"소파하고","meaning":"沙发","explanation":"소파：沙发；하고：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"소파","audio":"/audio/d6dab8e7a021c768cde2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62508","senseId":"1","lemma":"소파","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소파하고","audio":"/audio/6abea3ad36e360e92f95.mp3"}},{"text":"일인용","meaning":"一人用、单人座","explanation":"일：一（汉字数词）；인：人（人数单位）；-용：供……使用。일인용 指单人使用，不是“引用”。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"},{"term":"인","audio":"/audio/4929f7cc03943d2c008e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31528","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"24998","senseId":"2","lemma":"인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일인용","audio":"/audio/ba84610ebaf8fc833e65.mp3"}},{"text":"소파를","meaning":"沙发","explanation":"소파：沙发；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소파","audio":"/audio/d6dab8e7a021c768cde2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62508","senseId":"1","lemma":"소파","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}